    "value_statement": "Azure ML setup often requires many SDK calls across workspaces, assets, jobs, and compute. This skill provides focused Python SDK v2 examples for common Azure ML operations.",
    "seo_keywords": [
      "Claude",
      "Codex",
      "Claude Code",
