    "actual_capabilities": [
      "Shows how to install azure-ai-ml and configure required Azure ML environment variables.",
      "Demonstrates MLClient authentication with DefaultAzureCredential and config-based setup.",
      "Provides examples for workspaces, data assets, models, compute clusters, environments, and datastores.",
      "Shows how to create command jobs and stream Azure ML job logs.",
      "Outlines a basic Azure ML pipeline with data preparation and training steps."
